  "prefLabel": "Agr 4105.01 Review of Program Data",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 4105.01 Review of Program Data.\n\n(a) The department shall collect and monitor all animal records information required by RSA 437:8-a through software provided by the program vendor.\n\n(b) The department shall review and evaluate the collected information for errors or completeness.\n\nSource. #14163, eff 1-7-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr4100.html"
